I arrive at the office.
I sit at my desk.
I turn on my computer.
I start my work.
There is a difficult code on the screen.
I do not understand this code.
Just then, Rohan comes over to my desk.
Rohan is my colleague.
He says, "Good morning Maya."
I say, "Good morning Rohan, I need help with this code."
Rohan smiles and looks at my screen.
We both read the code together.
Rohan shows me a mistake in the code.
I fix that mistake.
We run the code again.
Now the software works perfectly fine.
I am very happy.
I say thank you to Rohan.
Rohan goes back to his desk.
